        "summary":  "Anthropic partnered with Accenture\u0027s Faculty division to conduct independent evaluations of frontier AI models through an embedded approach, with evaluators working inside Anthropic with employee-level access. Both organizations plan to invest at least $1 billion over five years, with Anthropic funding this partnership while pursuing additional evaluators using alternative funding models. The arrangement is designed to identify model safety blind spots and assess development commitments from the inside.",
