        "summary":  "AWS demonstrates a scalable architecture combining Amazon EKS, Elastic Fabric Adapter (EFA), and DeepEP to optimize large-scale reinforcement learning training for Mixture-of-Experts models. The optimization achieves 40% throughput improvement by enabling specialized expert-parallel communication over EFA, addressing bottlenecks in inter-node token routing across multiple GPU instances. Cost-saving techniques such as Spot Instances for inference and decoupled compute components further reduce operational expenses.",
