        "execSummary":  "This consolidation move is Microsoft\u0027s clearest signal yet that enterprise AI is moving from point tools to integrated operating environments — and that cost accountability, not just capability, is now a top customer demand. The new FinOps features that expose agent performance metrics and actual productivity gains are the most strategically important element: they give CIOs the data needed to justify or cut AI spend. For customer-support leaders, the unified context layer (Fabric IQ and Work IQ) is directly relevant — it means Copilot agents can draw on a fuller picture of customer and organizational data, reducing the context gaps that cause failures in support scenarios. Organizations with deep Microsoft 365 investments should accelerate their Copilot strategy review given this platform consolidation.",
